[
  {
    "id": "2e4c5bc0",
    "speaker": "澪",
    "text": "靴、そこに置いて。床ちょっと濡れてる。",
    "model": "まお",
    "style": "おちつき",
    "styleId": 888753763,
    "seconds": 3.664,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "142fc04438be918a3404bdb95fc47ca922a49f3e0b8d3a0840a4dcc6fbae80a1"
  },
  {
    "id": "0d27d122",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "先生から連絡は？",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 1.926,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "14079979526d8e433fc0b3b1a6c18fbfed7ddb7ed53b65123c7f66671d69d603"
  },
  {
    "id": "86804032",
    "speaker": "澪",
    "text": "まだ。宿の電話も駄目だって。でも村のWi-Fiなら、さっきのページが開く。蓮に送ったら、返ってきたよ。",
    "model": "まお",
    "style": "おちつき",
    "styleId": 888753763,
    "seconds": 8.913,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "0a7f9b436d015e3b98bfc9d4f5e2a1c69cfea82bdf2caf15121af3243e9392ed"
  },
  {
    "id": "18e99b02",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "外にはつながらないのか。……じゃあ、移動したらここに書こう。五人とも見られるように。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 6.484,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "992afbb56e97bb4140d041c5b0ab14dd19117f20c70f35cda58bd0530603ad1e"
  },
  {
    "id": "6517f5dc",
    "speaker": "澪",
    "text": "うん。充電もここでできるって。帰り、また寄ろう。",
    "model": "まお",
    "style": "おちつき",
    "styleId": 888753763,
    "seconds": 4.534,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "062317cff2155134006e06cfffb9688a62de2ea3abcd31e47f608d434ebe8abe"
  },
  {
    "id": "194d8e0d",
    "speaker": "律",
    "text": "そこ踏まないで。縄、傷んでる。",
    "model": "M2",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1368642336,
    "seconds": 3.044,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "f272595ce5aa172154f424371f41d3195bc0d2f511912600dd770a4f4fbfbfe9"
  },
  {
    "id": "460eed1b",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "何してるの。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 1.392,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "52de6293a58bb2bbade505bc224ac4c959357d69978d5d03835a34cce4a09857"
  },
  {
    "id": "cb636cfa",
    "speaker": "律",
    "text": "桶を上げてる。落とした時計、まだ動いてるんだけど……こっちと合わない。",
    "model": "M2",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1368642336,
    "seconds": 5.773,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "441ac36fe7ec7f3ceebea8211e009cb411ee785577cfcb56fea9c52fc80c3479"
  },
  {
    "id": "cce73ccf",
    "speaker": "栞",
    "text": "蒼、今、何か言った？",
    "model": "花音",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1325133120,
    "seconds": 2.815,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "fcf4c27c4e8eaf50d9f2c7041bdde1ea4297538b114ba0d44ab9362147766425"
  },
  {
    "id": "ad4681db",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "言ってない。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 1.136,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "70bb2c9d07f7e42a514b7879702f15e32c0c9656e59b651fb76f6763739eccd4"
  },
  {
    "id": "80450fa4",
    "speaker": "栞",
    "text": "……そっか。じゃあ、いい。",
    "model": "花音",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1325133120,
    "seconds": 2.446,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "8d888315b51bf9e63d4d24e4fc7362b798ec5dc9e7e3dbd9c48decb7010c4622"
  },
  {
    "id": "a783912d",
    "speaker": "村の老人",
    "text": "皿は返さなくていい。そこへ置きな。",
    "model": "阿井田 茂",
    "style": "Heavy",
    "styleId": 1310138979,
    "seconds": 3.066,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "ef2c2d2c6ba8723b70438d51484e012ae067ee2f67c15016e7fc261014ae93c9"
  },
  {
    "id": "ec1b0039",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "お祭り、いつまでやるんですか。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 2.63,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "61d91d7adf9bd0352f6b9a4cfd7faa5d8cfa23c996368f439e5d1f2c3dc2521d"
  },
  {
    "id": "7dd1567c",
    "speaker": "村の老人",
    "text": "鐘が止まるまでだよ。あんたら、眠くなったら宿へ戻りな。ひとりで寝るんじゃないよ。",
    "model": "阿井田 茂",
    "style": "Heavy",
    "styleId": 1310138979,
    "seconds": 6.248,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "40ed2b5a0ca2435e05d3d876e515eefdbd8c8f83400bbc85f92a240eb3b5b029"
  },
  {
    "id": "23548d2f",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "誰かいますか。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 1.566,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "919303e87193989a8c413b0aca97cc49fcc64c67e542cc9417ee0655db0944f5"
  },
  {
    "id": "31cf8bee",
    "speaker": "運転手",
    "text": "お乗り間違いのないように。",
    "model": "阿井田 茂",
    "style": "Calm",
    "styleId": 1310138977,
    "seconds": 2.019,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "d44eb317ae188f5d56804f84c2ab1e4ece4caf5f7f876737711f28fa79b4f45e"
  },
  {
    "id": "1cd5683c",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "……迎えに来たんですか。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 1.914,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "67980b8f11bad79472ba3ee0c2cb09fa18d92534021e5ec9c36c0b8fbf1ac8e3"
  },
  {
    "id": "2aa5e667",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "この道、下の鳥居まで続いてるはずなのに。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 3.294,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "31c430edbfd3bb0d73718b51a6f4d5546234b9047dc6603f582a3510cb09ad10"
  },
  {
    "id": "59279839",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "バスを降りたのは、ここだった。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 2.504,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "83a6b5740e27af81956b12624781113b661389e5352c2330d4f43abb34d5bb08"
  },
  {
    "id": "61cdbf65",
    "speaker": "蓮",
    "text": "蒼、乗る前に写真。先生に、五人そろったって送っとく。",
    "model": "澤原 玄二郎",
    "style": "close",
    "styleId": 2029042369,
    "seconds": 3.999,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "834c827bbc799d5410b003a191e7b910f731aef6c71f8426c91b6f8bc9781dd9"
  },
  {
    "id": "c323198f",
    "speaker": "澪",
    "text": "待って、私が撮る。……指入った。あとで撮り直そう。",
    "model": "まお",
    "style": "おちつき",
    "styleId": 888753763,
    "seconds": 4.836,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "88dfc95a9c4cc1d04a444bfc2247768df74a9281ba1372d95c4f3b4fa25d76f9"
  },
  {
    "id": "59f4f891",
    "speaker": "運転手",
    "text": "本隊には途中で追いつきます。山道ですから、座っていてください。",
    "model": "阿井田 茂",
    "style": "Calm",
    "styleId": 1310138977,
    "seconds": 4.759,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "30c0ead6c1ea67c6a2ea4a9b3ed98cbaab742443d172dde1f5015875954c1ba1"
  },
  {
    "id": "eecffee6",
    "speaker": "律",
    "text": "……長いな、このトンネル。さっき、こんな道あった？",
    "model": "M2",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1368642336,
    "seconds": 3.904,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "55a01609cd88bbdf7dba85c4bb611117a0acee5822612b18b174b592c0a35480"
  },
  {
    "id": "697b3a36",
    "speaker": "運転手",
    "text": "この先で土砂が出ましてね。今夜は村の宿でお待ちください。本隊には私から連絡します。",
    "model": "阿井田 茂",
    "style": "Calm",
    "styleId": 1310138977,
    "seconds": 6.965,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "8e7c8cb7f5bcebb5b04bc01f747553b9763b7c2c7251df7f4770900223708553"
  },
  {
    "id": "f73dbb4a",
    "speaker": "蓮",
    "text": "先生に直接、電話できますか。俺たちからも話したいです。",
    "model": "澤原 玄二郎",
    "style": "close",
    "styleId": 2029042369,
    "seconds": 4.149,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "a9f0d31dc1133120b0f5dd50a81c32172a5ba29decb680441eb2f806ca9e759d"
  },
  {
    "id": "e5da7988",
    "speaker": "運転手",
    "text": "宿の電話をお使いください。お荷物、お忘れなく。",
    "model": "阿井田 茂",
    "style": "Calm",
    "styleId": 1310138977,
    "seconds": 3.877,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "7ab618109ea4a688a2f697d5d51002f9f4224e3f5f437f20065a7a9edcdf1399"
  },
  {
    "id": "81597a4e",
    "speaker": "栞",
    "text": "あの子、鈴つけてる。……大人もいる。宿、聞いてみよう。",
    "model": "花音",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1325133120,
    "seconds": 5.815,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "47066b0be703de0295f69218fac802a9143d274142a827f92c9067e04cf30ca7"
  },
  {
    "id": "3ebabde8",
    "speaker": "澪",
    "text": "ここで待ってれば、迎えが来るんだよね。台所は使っていいって。夕飯、どうしよう。",
    "model": "まお",
    "style": "おちつき",
    "styleId": 888753763,
    "seconds": 6.427,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "d895aa12ed21c467d41255fac1991f43f7f2ae9cec5539890cb3848a28370316"
  },
  {
    "id": "6d89d174",
    "speaker": "律",
    "text": "外への電話は駄目だけど、村の連絡ページは動く。五人の部屋を作った。移動する前に、そこへ書こう。",
    "model": "M2",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1368642336,
    "seconds": 8.246,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "948dfab00b455cecba9a183617981be9a282f5042339c5cfdfa5b5147ae6259e"
  },
  {
    "id": "57510268",
    "speaker": "蓮",
    "text": "荷物はここ。夜中には一度、全員戻ろう。蒼、最初に井戸の道を確かめてきてくれる？",
    "model": "澤原 玄二郎",
    "style": "close",
    "styleId": 2029042369,
    "seconds": 5.636,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "fccc2f46402b0ca09cfe15afecb1a90b4399b6b2c3db02c6e5c76ce23016b4c4"
  },
  {
    "id": "6f6d7b21",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "うん。先に灯りと縄、借りてく。何かあったら、すぐ呼んで。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 5.533,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "710e591e4eea8ce77c3d521f0057ef88edb9b20c0c9a0ba6108081d342d8238a"
  },
  {
    "id": "87f16ed4",
    "speaker": "蓮",
    "text": "一回、整理しよう。外へつながる道、見つかった人は？",
    "model": "澤原 玄二郎",
    "style": "close",
    "styleId": 2029042369,
    "seconds": 3.801,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "fcf478e86aab76b9fee63ced58dbebb8f91ab67d645708383bc34bab9526e05a"
  },
  {
    "id": "58b07bad",
    "speaker": "律",
    "text": "道標まで戻った。地図のせいじゃない。井戸の時計も、普通じゃなかった。",
    "model": "M2",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1368642336,
    "seconds": 6.086,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "3bdc853e1882251c1abffbcd403329401998f2bd0525f7c590ad7dd40d6edc93"
  },
  {
    "id": "95020a39",
    "speaker": "澪",
    "text": "さっき笛のあと、子供がいなくなった。宿の人に聞いたら、もう寝なさいって。",
    "model": "まお",
    "style": "おちつき",
    "styleId": 888753763,
    "seconds": 6.268,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "40808e1cc50f89101c357d0319ff74418c3102b3f408d863e467c050efd2d5eb"
  },
  {
    "id": "4b3f8bf1",
    "speaker": "栞",
    "text": "追いかけたくなる音だった。……明日は、一人で決めないようにしたい。",
    "model": "花音",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1325133120,
    "seconds": 5.555,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "9135ca5f97c22766589477ce39e9e70ea781a7602a94786a785b9174c5798855"
  },
  {
    "id": "2f47757c",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "二人ずつ動くか、道具を揃えて手分けするか。危ないことは、人の代わりに道具で確かめよう。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 7.351,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "6adf76629812760081c76542c02123b1eda61838a03427e555fa1b73a3f6ddf3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b08f3cc2",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "あと一時間。日記の手順を揃えて、最後の五分に間に合わせる。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 5.152,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "399c89638581e51a91e32647564ee7e6912f84b665a6b25c2ce64badf1fa8549"
  },
  {
    "id": "8048e2b0",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "うっ……！",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 1.287,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "327078ecdd0c257a3d436873f254a7dd6974a769ea5d819c68f3b40059f25980"
  },
  {
    "id": "96de4f2f",
    "speaker": "蓮",
    "text": "おい、蒼！　大丈夫か？　肩、つかまれ。",
    "model": "澤原 玄二郎",
    "style": "close-shout",
    "styleId": 2029042370,
    "seconds": 3.22,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "6f4c1d066587590edbe49d10f8932b3e7251e8aa21aa04b22f0ac264c72815a5"
  },
  {
    "id": "7d02da9a",
    "speaker": "澪",
    "text": "顔、真っ白。ここで座って。水、出すから。",
    "model": "まお",
    "style": "おちつき",
    "styleId": 888753763,
    "seconds": 3.977,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "dd15177ccd3a38e15f78827cdbbe2b3da0008ca56a4ceeeaae39dd10ecfcf30c"
  },
  {
    "id": "28dbfa63",
    "speaker": "運転手",
    "text": "先で土砂が出てましてね。本隊には私から連絡します。",
    "model": "阿井田 茂",
    "style": "Calm",
    "styleId": 1310138977,
    "seconds": 4.388,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "92415f9329704c7efb35c5f235ad35bed12a724ea49778a5fd9d0112bc4bfc17"
  },
  {
    "id": "4eabbd5a",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "……止めて。ここで降りないで。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 2.808,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "96ea0f10f8b2545b7f8d724e6da6e27981aafedf2d0364ada6220e2c0cc3dc18"
  },
  {
    "id": "f6fd458f",
    "speaker": "蓮",
    "text": "蒼？　寝ぼけてる？",
    "model": "澤原 玄二郎",
    "style": "close",
    "styleId": 2029042369,
    "seconds": 1.955,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "158c1b32f10e5742b80ad47f00491da6f0e374bfd2ae58cc6401228645dd6c44"
  },
  {
    "id": "0304813c",
    "speaker": "蒼",
    "text": "いや。……ごめん。ちょっと、待って。",
    "model": "にせ",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1937616896,
    "seconds": 3.342,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "b2ac20cdca80661ff94d7b2e5ba2bcac31828dd90bf7d0e4ba3e81d71ad6328a"
  },
  {
    "id": "586b1d22",
    "speaker": "蓮",
    "text": "もう一度だけ。誰がどこへ行くか、確認しよう。",
    "model": "澤原 玄二郎",
    "style": "close",
    "styleId": 2029042369,
    "seconds": 3.314,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "119b80dd4612f0f85bc717b6613d45bad4f5852476b28307717e1fbd56c0151e"
  },
  {
    "id": "c9d6a632",
    "speaker": "律",
    "text": "井戸には入らない。鏡を下ろして、森に出たことを無線で確認する。それまで縄は切らない。",
    "model": "M2",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1368642336,
    "seconds": 7.433,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
    "sha256": "521cd78ea114ce2a12938deabacf99bf147ebf8d07ca06b7e8fdccb7cb38d2f0"
  },
  {
    "id": "3126d19e",
    "speaker": "栞",
    "text": "鏡が来たら、私が返事する。歌は……最後まで覚えた。",
    "model": "花音",
    "style": "ノーマル",
    "styleId": 1325133120,
    "seconds": 6.006,
    "source": "NeverAgainFilm.cs",
